# The fortified turtle, choke-wall arm (turtle 85, riposte 1, creep 50):
# the evolve1-g4m2-turtle85r hold and counter-punch with the turret walk
# held at half the anchor-to-enemy line, every third structure a repair
# bay -- the self-healing kill zone the community feeds the AI's
# seventeen-second groups into (ai-opponent-strategy). The walk alone at
# Impossible read on imp-creep12 and the cover24 turtle never had the
# repair bay or a counter-punch; this arm is the guides' posture as a
# whole: wall, repair, held army, punch when a wave breaks. Built for
# impfort96 beside the gun-wall arm. Every other knob and every goals
# slot is the champion's exactly.
